          "comment": "1m2f maiden winner; previous form stacks up; this mark could underestimate him",
          "spotlight": "The form of his three seconds worked out well and he managed to justify odds-on favouritism in a muddling maiden at Nottingham (stepped up to 1m2f; good) on reappearance; unlikely he was seen to best effect that day and this mark could underestimate him.",
