          "comment": "2-2 in a visor, following C&D success with cosy Epsom victory; high on the list",
          "spotlight": "Lightly raced 4yo who has won four of his nine starts (all wins over 6f, on a variety of ground); overcame some adversity when winning at Epsom on Derby day and a 6lb rise was justified; 2-2 since a visor went on, including C&D, and he's a leading contender.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-07",
              "horse": "Sondad",
              "horse_id": "hrs_37316748",
              "race": "JRA Tokyo Trophy Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11635689",
              "course": "Epsom",
              "course_id": "crs_442",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1323",
              "quote": "I wouldn't take it at face value that Sondad likes that ground, but it's so wet out there that he just slopped through it. He won so well on good to firm at Ascot that it was a bit of an unknown, but he's just come on by leaps and bounds with another year on his back. I was panicking slightly wondering if it would open up for him, but I had enough momentum and I've ridden him a lot of times. I've got a bit of a soft spot for him - Joanna Mason, jockey."
            }
          ],
