          "spotlight": "Unexposed 3yo; ready winner at Doncaster on his reappearance and he confirmed himself a promising sprinter when second of 18 in a hot York event on last month's handicap debut (6f, good to firm); hit with a 5lb rise but he's got more to offer; tongue-tie now added.",
