          "comment": "Bolted up off reduced mark at Doncaster two weeks ago; up 10lb but still feasibly treated",
          "spotlight": "The type that needs things to fall right for him but talented when they do, as evidenced by his emphatic success at Doncaster 13 days ago (6f, good to firm); hit with a 10lb rise but he still has handicapping scope; ran creditably in one previous visit to Ascot.",
