          "comment": "Won at Redcar but too free when eighth at York since; very much the sort to bounce back",
          "spotlight": "Took his form up a level when scoring at Redcar (1m2f) in May but he raced too freely when only eighth in 1m2f York handicap four weeks ago; he's very much the sort to bounce back though.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-05-26",
              "horse": "Liberty Coach",
              "horse_id": "hrs_40312986",
              "race": "Racing TV Zetland Gold Cup Handicap (GBBPlus Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11621142",
              "course": "Redcar",
              "course_id": "crs_1222",
              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2201",
              "quote": "Liberty Coach is a very likeable horse and I'm delighted the owners kept him, as there were a lot of people trying to buy him last year. It's horses like him we're trying to hold on to. He had a very good year last year and found his mojo at the back end. We felt he'd come on from last time, and he loves galloping tracks like this. He'll want three weeks before we go again. We'll be pitching him in to run in races for better money now, which is great - John Quinn, joint-trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-08-17",
              "horse": "Liberty Coach",
              "horse_id": "hrs_40312986",
              "race": "Believe Specialist Finance Apprentice Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11348142",
              "course": "Doncaster",
              "course_id": "crs_390",
              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2243",
              "quote": "It's nice to get Liberty Coach's head in front. He's showed good ability in maidens and handicaps and it was frustrating he had yet to be a winner before now. He's quite a big horse and I'd be hopeful he could keep progressing - Sean Quinn, joint-trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's a big unraced gelding who's likely to start off over 1m2f at Doncaster this weekend. I quite like him and he has the make and shape of a nice middle-distance horse. 20-03-24"
            }
          ],
