          "comment": "Had wind surgery since last seen a few weeks ago; 5f and softer ground always been optimal",
          "spotlight": "Keen-going front-runner who's 2lb lower than when last successful and has landed a handy stall; in no form this season, though, and has undergone wind surgery since last seen a few weeks ago; 5f and softer ground always been optimal.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-09-30",
              "horse": "Never Dark",
              "horse_id": "hrs_18962643",
              "race": "cavani.co.uk The Dapper Dash For Cash Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11031345",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "Alex gave Never Dark a really good ride. He had a feather weight and not many jockeys can do that weight so we were looking for a good apprentice who can claim. And he gave him a lovely, straightforward ride. We had him in at Ripon as well but it's undulating there and it doesn't suit every horse. The key to this horse is he handles dig in the ground and he's come to himself this year. He seems to have found a bit of confidence - Iain Jardine, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-06-03",
              "horse": "Never Dark",
              "horse_id": "hrs_18962643",
              "race": "Unibet Thanks The Frontline Workers Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_9848982",
              "course": "Kempton (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_28054",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "Never Dark jumped really well and never saw another rival after that. He's pretty sensible within himself and could go back over six but I'd like to see him running over five furlongs on the grass. The whole family all progressed with age and over the winter he has strengthened, and I would imagine he'll take a big step forward - David Probert, jockey."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's a really quick horse. He's big and takes a bit of time to get right but once you get him to full fitness he's very consistent. He won at Nottingham and then his next run at York maybe came too soon, the ground was also a bit tacky. There are plenty more nice races in him. 26-07-24"
            }
          ],
