          "comment": "Scrambled home in the Empress (Listed) over C&D but continues to be a solid performer",
          "spotlight": "Scrambled home in a bunched finish for the Empress Stakes over C&D (good to firm; Listed) but took her record to 21211 and continues to be a solid performer; closely matched with Venetian Sun on Carlisle form, albeit with that rival bringing a higher rating after Royal Ascot success.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-26",
              "horse": "Argentine Tango",
              "horse_id": "hrs_51866346",
              "race": "Empress Fillies' Stakes (Listed Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11652121",
              "course": "Newmarket (July)",
              "course_id": "crs_4524",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "I couldn't believe Argentine Tango was 9-1 as she was second to Karl Burke's Royal Ascot winner Venetian Sun at Carlisle the time before last giving her 6lb. Somehow she was rated only 84 and Venetian Sun is now 20lb higher. I would say that Tim, as a Yorkshireman, would want to have a crack at the Lowther at York instead [of the Empress Fillies' Stakes]- Terry Holdcroft, owner-breeder."
            },
            {
              "date": "2025-05-24",
              "horse": "Argentine Tango",
              "horse_id": "hrs_51866346",
              "race": "Hilary Needler Trophy EBF Fillies' Conditions Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11620518",
              "course": "Beverley",
              "course_id": "crs_156",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "That was brilliant. Argentine Tango is really tough and genuine, she tries like hell.  We don't know about Ascot. It depends what the ground is like, if it was sparking fast ground we probably wouldn't go - Tim Easterby, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2025-04-30",
              "horse": "Argentine Tango",
              "horse_id": "hrs_51866346",
              "race": "Racing TV Club Day EBF Maiden Stakes (GBB/IRE Incentive Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11590501",
              "course": "Pontefract",
              "course_id": "crs_1196",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1103",
              "quote": "Argentine Tango is as hard as nails and was very hard to break in. But she's tough and she'll improve masses. When the other horse came to her she went again. We might take her to York for the Marygate Stakes - Tim Easterby, trainer."
            }
          ],
