          "comment": "Close in 2m Sandown Listed race last time; due to go up 6lb; still not the percentage call",
          "spotlight": "Second run this term was poor (he also produced some of those for his previous stable); there's been little to quibble with in his other three outings for new yard, close third in 2m Sandown Listed race on latest and due to go up 6lb after this, but he still does not look the percentage call.",
