          "comment": "Has never been better and his latest form (tight finish) has been boosted by 1st and 3rd",
          "spotlight": "Short-head winner at the other Newmarket track (1m6f, good to firm; made all) on second start this term and nearly made it 3-3 under Saffie Osborne at Goodwood (1m6f, good; led over 1f out) later in May, holding Dancing In Paris by a short head but pipped by subsequent Royal Ascot winner French Master; up 2lb today, as is Dancing In Paris, and looks a leading contender.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-05-04",
              "horse": "Story Horse",
              "horse_id": "hrs_35244272",
              "race": "Betfred Handicap (Heritage Handicap) (GBBPlus Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11575616",
              "course": "Newmarket",
              "course_id": "crs_988",
              "distance_f": "14",
              "distance_y": "3080",
              "quote": "The key ingredient in a racehorse is that will to win, and Story Horse has it. We tried the Cesarewitch last year and that was too far. I do think he'll get two miles dropped in though. He can run in those nice staying handicaps through the season. He likes fast ground, he had a nice weight today and the way the race worked out with the tailwind helped him too - William Knight, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-07-19",
              "horse": "Story Horse",
              "horse_id": "hrs_35244272",
              "race": "Join Racing TV Now Handicap (Jockey Club Grassroots Stayers Series Qualifier)",
              "race_id": "rac_11325847",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "14",
              "distance_y": "3080",
              "quote": "It was a really nice, straightforward performance. Story Horse was unlucky not to win the last day as he was very impressive at Lingfield. It was nice to see him get his head in front and I had a very smooth trip round. It couldn't have been easier - Saffie Osborne, jockey."
            }
          ],
