          "comment": "Best to forgive latest effort; consistent otherwise this term and still unexposed at 7f",
          "spotlight": "Had an excuse (raced on unfavoured side) when beaten favourite over C&D last term; consistent otherwise this season and although record is just 1-17 he remains unexposed at 7f.",
