          "comment": "Continues on the up and she looks set to give it another good go back down in class",
          "spotlight": "Good progress last year and she's been back on the up on her last two starts, third at Haydock before finishing fourth in a Group 1 at Royal Ascot; beaten over 4l on that occasion but the first two home are high-quality performers and she wasn't far behind a smart filly in third; could have further progress in her.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-07-24",
              "horse": "Nighteyes",
              "horse_id": "hrs_35388444",
              "race": "Yeomanstown Stud Irish EBF Stakes (Listed Race) (Fillies & Mares)",
              "race_id": "rac_11351782",
              "course": "Naas",
              "course_id": "crs_4992",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1305",
              "quote": "Nighteyes definitely has ability and is improving all the time. She has progressed into a lovely three-year-old. She picked up really well and hit the line very strong - Danny Tudhope, rider"
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "She could improve a lot this year and be right up there. She shouldn't have won that Listed race at Naas but ended up winning going away. She had an injury after her last run, but she's in good order now. She's a big, strong filly who should be getting quicker all the time. She'll probably start off over six in the Kilvington at Newmarket next month. 14-04-25"
            }
          ],
