          "comment": "In and out but her good days would bring her right into the reckoning",
          "spotlight": "Group 2 win as a 2yo and also third in the Group 1 Cheveley Park; better than ever when second in a Haydock Group 2 in May but she failed to back it up in the Commonwealth Cup; each-way shout.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-04-15",
              "horse": "Arabian Dusk",
              "horse_id": "hrs_41564929",
              "race": "Lanwades Stud Nell Gwyn Stakes (Group 3) (Fillies)",
              "race_id": "rac_11574979",
              "course": "Newmarket",
              "course_id": "crs_988",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "James Doyle [jockey] thought Arabian Dusk was going best at the Bushes but struggled up the hill. She'll probably drop back to six furlongs - Chris Wall, owner's racing manager."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-07-12",
              "horse": "Arabian Dusk",
              "horse_id": "hrs_41564929",
              "race": "Duchess Of Cambridge Stakes (Sponsored By bet365) (Group 2) (Fillies)",
              "race_id": "rac_11316357",
              "course": "Newmarket (July)",
              "course_id": "crs_4524",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "I'm not sure the Guineas will be the right trip for Arabian Dusk but she certainly wasn't stopping at the end of the race today - in fact she was looking for a bit of company and I think she would have gone again if she had been challenged in the last 50 yards. I think we'll stick to this trip for the moment and maybe look at the Lowther Stakes at York and Cheveley Park and see what we are like over the winter. The reality is she came here today as a maiden and now she has won that race we know she has a lot of ability with a great temperament. There is every reason to think she can keep advancing as the season progresses - Simon Crisford, joint-trainer."
            }
          ],
