          "comment": "A shade disappointing when 2nd at Ayr last time but on the up beforehand; return to 6f a +",
          "spotlight": "Placed in six of her seven starts (7f excuses her sole disappointing effort) and she improved on her three wins when finishing a close third of nine in the Group 2 Sandy Lane Stakes at Haydock in May (6f, good); a bit disappointing when turned over by an 87-rated 50-1 shot at Ayr three weeks ago; returning to 6f can help and she's more appealing than most.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-05-06",
              "horse": "First Instinct",
              "horse_id": "hrs_43860222",
              "race": "Goffs Irish EBF Polonia Stakes (Listed Race) (Fillies)",
              "race_id": "rac_11630866",
              "course": "Cork",
              "course_id": "crs_15496",
              "distance_f": "5.5",
              "distance_y": "1210",
              "quote": "Mr Haggas was bullish with First Instinct and thought she had a good chance. She jumped so fast coming out of the gates that I nearly came off, but she got into her stride really quick. Billie (Lee, on Town And Country) was coming quick, but I was pulling out more. I'd be happy at today's distance - Chris Hayes, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-09-06",
              "horse": "First Instinct",
              "horse_id": "hrs_43860222",
              "race": "Tattersalls £40,000 EBF Fillies' Novice Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11361051",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "First Instinct has been faultless. I was a bit worried that the ground today might just blunt her speed but she fell asleep early - which was key I think - and showed that trademark turn of foot which she showed on her first run. I think she'll be even more effective on better ground - Tom Marquand, jockey, speaking to Racing TV."
            }
          ],
