          "comment": "Could have more to offer but such progress is a must now stepping up to Group 3 company",
          "spotlight": "Progressive 2yo; two solid efforts in 2025, not beaten far in a fillies' handicap over C&D four weeks ago; more required at this level.",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "She ran well first time out in the Cecil Frail behind a winner who finished second in the King Charles III Stakes at Royal Ascot. Then she was drawn out of it at York next time - the main action was up the stands' rail and she was the best finisher from a low draw. We'll probably stick to stakes company with her now as she's highly rated and lumping big weights in handicaps isn't easy for a small filly. We'll look at something like the Summer Stakes back at York. 02-07-25"
            }
          ],
