          "comment": "Has been in fine form, winning three of last four, latest over C&D; up another 9lb; chance",
          "spotlight": "In fine form recently, winning three of last four races, latest a C&D handicap by 3l under today's rider (excuses for defeat at Newbury the previous day); up another 9lb so 18lb higher than for start of winning run, but not without a chance.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2022-04-29",
              "horse": "Dawn Of Liberation",
              "horse_id": "hrs_25702096",
              "race": "British Stallion Studs EBF Conditions Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_10512268",
              "course": "Goodwood",
              "course_id": "crs_546",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Dawn Of Liberation ran so badly at Newmarket last time and nobody could really understand that. He emptied, but was quite free, so a mile might be better for him. He's still a baby and I think Churchill's progeny will just get better as they go on. We thought a lot of him before Newmarket - Paul Roy, owner."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He'd sometimes been running to 102 and other times to 82, so we've tidied his wind up and I think he'll go to a handicap at Newmarket on Guineas day. He wouldn't want it soft. 02-05-23"
            },
            {
              "quote": "There's a £20,000 race at Musselburgh on Sunday lined up for this well-bred sort. It's for those rated 41-68 and, as he's 68, it's the perfect opportunity. This time last year he was rated 85, so he has become well handicapped. 09-04-25"
            }
          ],
