              "course_id": "crs_260",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "Castan did it nicely and Kevin never hit him. He said all day long that Castan would win these types of races and I'm delighted for the owners - Bryan Smart, trainer."
