          "comment": "Step back in the right direction when 2nd at Wexford in May; needs career best though",
          "spotlight": "Took a step back in the right direction when runner-up in four-runner race at Wexford in May, although was beaten 11l; needs either a career best or a couple of these to underperform to be in the mix; first-time cheekpieces could help.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-08-30",
              "horse": "Tag Man",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21327698",
              "race": "Pepsico (Walkers Snacks) Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_11381864",
              "course": "Down Royal",
              "course_id": "crs_4680",
              "distance_f": "24",
              "distance_y": "5280",
              "quote": "Tag Man was helped by the step up in trip., He got keen once or twice but I was happy and he picked up well - Rachael Blackmore, rider."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-06-07",
              "horse": "Tag Man",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21327698",
              "race": "Bulmers Original Novice Chase",
              "race_id": "rac_11311300",
              "course": "Clonmel",
              "course_id": "crs_4602",
              "distance_f": "20",
              "distance_y": "4400",
              "quote": "Tag Man was really good, it was a nice way to start over fences and I thought he jumped really well. He was racing against more experienced horses but he has a bit of class - Henry de Bromhead, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-04-28",
              "horse": "Tag Man",
              "horse_id": "hrs_21327698",
              "race": "JP & M Doyle Celebrating 70 Years In Business (C & G) Flat Race",
              "race_id": "rac_10539646",
              "course": "Punchestown",
              "course_id": "crs_5070",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3560",
              "quote": "Tag Man is a real galloping horse and fair play to Davy, he gave him a super ride. He's a key member of our team and I'm delighted for him - Henry de Bromhead, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He had a nice win over hurdles at Down Royal in August but didn't quite run to his best last time at Clonmel. We might go back over fences with him - he won first time out over fences this summer but was only ninth in a handicap chase afterwards. He stays three miles well and the better the ground the better for him. 18-11-24"
            }
          ],
