              "distance_f": "24",
              "distance_y": "5280",
              "quote": "Tullyhogue Fort is a bit of a learning job. He's been sick for a while since he won at Galway last year. He's always run well there. We kind of minded him there the last day as the ground was too soft but he ran through the line. I think he's better now taking his time. He learns a bit more about racing. It was great to win. He's an honest horse - Paul O'Neill, jockey."
