          "comment": "Last year's second runs well fresh and 3lb lower this time",
          "spotlight": "Mixed form last season but finished second in this race off 142 (favourite) and bounced back to form with excellent fourth of 30 in the Topham at Aintree in April; dropped out tamely at Punchestown festival month later;",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2022-04-22",
              "horse": "Amirite",
              "horse_id": "hrs_27040580",
              "race": "KilbegganRaces.com Maiden Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_10535824",
              "course": "Kilbeggan",
              "course_id": "crs_5278",
              "distance_f": "19",
              "distance_y": "4180",
              "quote": "I expected Amrite to win last time but I'm not convinced he loves real heavy ground. We waited for better ground after giving him a break. He looked really well today. The plan was to leave him in the field but we may look to a novice hurdle."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He ran really well when second in the Midlands National at Kilbeggan in July but has been disappointing since and a lot of that is probably my fault. He'll get a break now and come back for the spring. There's a good pot somewhere for him and we just need all the stars to align. 18-11-24"
            },
            {
              "quote": "He made a winning debut over fences at Fairyhouse this season from stablemate Secret She Keeps before making the frame in two Graded races. He has entries in the Brown Advisory Novices' Chase and the Kim Muir Handicap Chase and will go for one of those. 01-03-23"
            }
          ],
