          "comment": "Recent Roscommon win augurs well but 8lb rise makes this tough; reserve",
          "spotlight": "Second reserve; four chase wins include here over 2m3f and more recently over this trip at Roscommon last month, beating Ambitious Fellow; 8lb rise makes this tough.",
