          "comment": "Chased home a smart type here last month; big chance if staying longer trip",
          "spotlight": "Smart bumper form (winning here) and made winning hurdles debut (rated 130) at Punchestown in December; unseated early on chase debut at Tipperary in May before beaten odds-on favourite here last month but no disgrace when clear second to a smart type over 2m4f under 7lb claimer; Townend's choice from yard's trio of runners and big chance if staying.",
